## Architecture (mirrors the ApiLogsPage A7 admin-surface precedent — 6-file split)
- SecretRotationPageModel.kt      framework-free: SecretSeverityTone, RotationCounts, SecretRotationView,
                                  isSubsystemMissing, EM_DASH, recordSecretRotationPageOpened (no Compose/HTTP)
- SecretRotationPageSource.kt     SecretRotationSource seam + OperatorConfidenceStore.asSecretRotationSource()
- SecretRotationPageViewModel.kt  BaseFeedViewModel (P1/S8) → StateFlow<UiState<SecretRotationResponse>>
- SecretRotationPageIcons.kt      local stroked glyphs (ShieldCheck/AlertTriangle/AlertCircle) + badgeVariant()
- SecretRotationPage.kt           stateless Compose render layer (5 panels, 4 data states)
- SecretRotationPageHost.kt       PageHosts.register("adminSecretRotation")
Wiring:
- DataContainer.kt                + operatorConfidenceStore (HttpOperatorConfidenceRepository + S8 store) — DI seam
- TeslaSyncApplication.kt         + SecretRotationPageHost.register()  (nav/host registration)
- res/values{,-ar,-he}/strings.xml + 21 required keys + 9 severity/kind labels (zero hardcoded text, ADR-014)
- src/test/.../SecretRotationPageModelTest.kt  pure-model JVM unit test (8 cases)
- apps/parity/android-ledger.json  page:admin/SecretRotation covered row (30/30)

Data binding (ADR-002/004): the view performs NO HTTP. It collects
SecretRotationPageViewModel.state — a lifecycle-aware StateFlow<UiState<SecretRotationResponse>> projected by
BaseFeedViewModel.asUiState over the shared KMP core (P1/S8) OperatorConfidenceStore.secretRotation()
(GET /admin/observability/secret-rotation, web `useSecretRotation`). SI: the control-plane payload is
SI-agnostic (age in days, day thresholds, ISO stamps) — no unit conversion; locale number/date formatting is
applied only at the render boundary (SecretRotationFormats).

